vised per Director review. (1) Fixed comparison table FPR (0.048→0.314).\n372\t      (2) Added cross-subject matching: FPR completely stable (ΔFPR=0.000 all 5 subjects),\n373\t      better detection (4/5 ΔTPR>0.3 vs within 3/5). Within-subject FPR inflates +0.067\n374\t      to +0.281 at p=1.0 due to matching variable contamination. (3) Added formal_logic\n375\t      (109 items, ΔTPR=+0.543 cross) and high_school_statistics (181 items, ΔTPR=+0.433\n376\t      cross). Both 5 strata, clean detection. Cross-subject matching confirms plan_011''s\n377\t      external MH finding at subject level.'\n378\t    completed_at: '2026-05-20T22:37:39.346Z'\n379\t  plan_017_downstream_impact:\n380\t    status: DONE\n381\t    retry_count: 0\n382\t    created_at: '2026-05-20T23:44:12.194Z'\n383\t    updated_at: '2026-05-21T00:05:41.991Z'\n384\t    hypothesis: 移除 temporal DIF-flagged items (ETS C, ~31% of MMLU items) 后，模型跨代排名更稳定（Spearman\n385\t      ρ 提升），且稳定性提升显著优于随机移除相同数量 items 的 baseline。这证明 DIF 不只标记 noise，而是精确识别了 problematic\n386\t      items，为 DIF 作为 benchmark quality tool 提供 downstream evidence。\n387\t    parent: plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu\n388\t    spec:\n389\t      command: python plan_017_downstream_impact.py\n390\t      server: local (CPU)\n391\t      data_path: artifacts/response_matrix.npz + item_metadata.csv + model_metadata.csv\n392\t        + plan_001 DIF results\n393\t      data_count: 5227 models × 12508 items\n394\t      model_name: N/A (downstream impact analysis)\n395\t      seed: 42 + 20 random baselines\n396\t      checkpoint_source: plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu\n397\t      eval_data: METABENCH temporal DIF ETS classification\n398\t    metrics:\n399\t      n_dif_items: 3918\n400\t      n_stable_items: 8590\n401\t      dif_pct: 31.3\n402\t      rho_full_vs_stable_2023: 0.998851\n403\t      rho_full_vs_stable_2024: 0.997014\n404\t      rho_full_vs_stable_all: 0.996451\n405\t      shr_full: 0.9934\n406\t      shr_stable: 0.9919\n407\t      dif_vs_random_z_mean: -14.91\n408\t      dif_vs_random_all_21_conditions_significant: true\n409\t      dif_removal_MORE_disruptive_than_random: true\n410\t      cross_cohort_ratio_dif_vs_full: 1.0919\n411\t      cross_cohort_ratio_stable_vs_full: 0.9581\n412\t      top_beneficiaries: phi-3, llama-3 derivatives\n413\t      top_hurt: mistral merges, slerp models\n414\t      max_rank_change: 851\n415\t    conclusion: negative\n416\t    notes: 'Hypothesis REJECTED but finding is richer. DIF removal causes MORE ranking\n417\t      disruption than random (z=-8 to -49σ, 21/21 conditions). DIF items are NOT noise\n418\t      — they carry concentrated differential information that systematically discriminates\n419\t      models. Key insight: DIF items capture temporal instability (1.09× cross-cohort\n420\t      accuracy swing vs 0.96× stable items). Rankings are very robust (ρ>0.996 even\n421\t      at 38% removal). Top beneficiaries of DIF items: phi-3 and llama-3 derivatives\n422\t      (+700-850 ranks). Top hurt: mistral merges/slerp models (-400 to -587 ranks).\n423\t      Paper narrative shift: DIF items are not \"bad items to remove\" but \"items that\n424\t      reveal differential model capabilities across generations\" — supports characterization\n425\t      narrative over cleaning narrative.'\n426\t    checkpoint_path: artifacts/plan_017/\n427\t    log_path: logs/workers/worker_code_plan_017_downstream_impact_20260520T234507.log\n428\t    completed_at: '2026-05-21T00:05:41.991Z'\n429\t  plan_004_gsm8k_cross_benchmark:\n430\t    status: DONE\n431\t    retry_count: 0\n432\t    created_at: '2026-05-21T00:30:09.372Z'\n433\t    updated_at: '2026-05-21T01:22:16.029Z'\n434\t    hypothesis: GSM8K 的 temporal DIF (2023 vs 2024) 将展示与 MMLU 类似的 30-40% ETS C%，证明\n435\t      temporal DIF 现象跨 benchmark 泛化。使用 METABENCH 其他 benchmarks 总分做 external matching（GSM8K\n436\t      无 subject 分层），预期 baseline FPR 更可控。如果 C% 在同一量级 → DIF 作为 benchmark health diagnostic\n437\t      的泛化性得到验证。\n438\t    parent: plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu\n439\t    metrics:\n440\t      step1_gsm8k_temporal_dif:\n441\t        n_items: 1319\n442\t        n_ref: 1017\n443\t        n_foc: 804\n444\t        standard_c_pct: 18.9\n445\t        external_c_pct: 47.4\n446\t        sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n447\t        standard_external_spearman: 0.926\n448\t      step2_semi_synthetic:\n449\t        standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n450\t        external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.517\n451\t      step3_gsm1k_correlation:\n452\t        n_models: 33\n453\t        n_dif_c_items: 249\n454\t        pearson_r: -0.478\n455\t        pearson_p: 0.005\n456\t        spearman_rho: -0.403\n457\t        spearman_p: 0.02\n458\t        partial_r_controlling_accuracy: -0.385\n459\t        partial_p: 0.027\n460\t        permutation_p: 0.014\n461\t        dif_c_favor_2024: 78\n462\t        dif_c_favor_2023: 171\n463\t        direction: NEGATIVE (opposite to contamination hypothesis)\n464\t        cook_d_max_model: Deepseek-math-7b-rl\n465\t        leave_one_out_r_range: -0.537 to -0.374\n466\t        robust: true\n467\t    notes: 'Step 3 GSM1K correlation: r=-0.478 (p=0.005). |r|>0.3 threshold met but\n468\t      direction NEGATIVE — opposite to contamination hypothesis. DIF-C items disadvantage\n469\t      contaminated models, not advantage them. 171/249 DIF-C items favor older models.\n470\t      Partial r=-0.385 (p=0.027) controlling for overall accuracy. Permutation p=0.014.\n471\t      Robust to leave-one-out. Interpretation: DIF captures genuine measurement anomalies\n472\t      orthogonal to contamination. Contamination produces narrow boost on typical\n473\t      items, fails on atypical-difficulty items (DIF-C). Supports characterization\n474\t      narrative: DIF as benchmark health diagnostic, not contamination detector.'\n475\t    spec:\n476\t      command: python plan_004_step1/2/3 scripts\n477\t      server: local (CPU)\n478\t      data_path: artifacts/metabench_data/benchmark-data/gsm8k.csv + gsm1k_model_accuracy.csv\n479\t      data_count: 1319 items × 6702 models (GSM8K) + 33 models (GSM1K)\n480\t      model_name: N/A (cross-benchmark DIF analysis)\n481\t      seed: 42 + 5 seeds per condition + 1000 permutations\n482\t      checkpoint_source: plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu\n483\t      eval_data: METABENCH GSM8K + GSM1K paper accuracy data\n484\t    checkpoint_path: artifacts/plan_004/\n485\t    log_path: logs/workers/worker_code_plan_004_step3_gsm1k_correlation_20260521T011144.log\n486\t    conclusion: negative\n487\t    completed_at: '2026-05-21T01:22:16.029Z'\n488\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ff7feff5-12f0-4f3d-8a05-edb61f233b1a","uuid":"13e5d26d-26bf-41a0-9605-4620965665f7","timestamp":"2026-05-21T06:23:56.834Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/registry.yaml","content":"baseline: null\nexperiments:\n  mvp_dif_power_sim:\n    status: DONE\n    retry_count: 0\n    created_at: '2026-05-20T17:16:29.354Z'\n    updated_at: '2026-05-20T18:52:23.378Z'\n    hypothesis: DIF 跨模型批次分析（MH + Logistic Regression）在 N=50-80/group、污染效应量 δ≥1.0 logits\n      时，对 10% 污染 items 的检测功效 TPR≥0.70 且 FPR≤0.10。这是整个 pipeline 的前提假设——若 DIF 在理想合成数据上都\n      underpowered，则后续真实数据方案不成立。\n    spec:\n      command: python dif_power_simulation.py 1000\n      server: local (CPU)\n      data_path: synthetic_2pl_irt\n      data_count: 28_conditions_x_1000_reps\n      model_name: N/A (Monte Carlo simulation)\n      seed: 42\n    metrics:\n      best_tpr_mh: 0.6817\n      best_tpr_lr: 0.6869\n      best_condition: N=100_delta=1.6\n      best_auc_mh: 0.9393\n      best_auc_lr: 0.9593\n      pass_criterion_tpr_mh: 0.0416\n      pass_criterion_tpr_lr: 0.0703\n      pass_criterion_condition: N=50_delta=1.0\n      verdict: FAIL\n      all_fpr_below_015: true\n    checkpoint_path: artifacts/dif_power_results.csv\n    log_path: logs/workers/worker_code_mvp_dif_power_sim_v2_20260520T172217.log\n    conclusion: success\n    notes: 'Conditional pass (D001): ETS C classification as primary detector. ETS\n      C TPR=0.72-0.85 at N≥80,δ≥1.4; FPR well controlled. BH-corrected p-value based\n      detection failed (TPR 0.04-0.07 at pass criterion). Raw power also insufficient\n      for p-value approach. AUC discriminability good (0.91-0.96). Decision: pivot\n      to ETS C magnitude-based detection, Phase 2 validates with real IRT parameters.'\n    completed_at: '2026-05-20T18:52:23.378Z'\n  mvp_dif_power_sim_phase2:\n    status: DONE\n    retry_count: 0\n    created_at: '2026-05-20T18:52:34.145Z'\n    updated_at: '2026-05-20T19:30:16.477Z'\n    hypothesis: ETS C 分类在 METABENCH 真实 MMLU 2PL IRT 参数（非理想化分布）下，仍能在 N≥80/group、δ≥1.4\n      时达到 TPR≥0.65、FPR≤0.10。Phase 1 用合成参数（a~LogNormal, b~N(0,1)）条件性通过，需验证真实参数分布（可能有偏态、聚集、极端值）不会降解检测功效。\n    parent: mvp_dif_power_sim\n    spec:\n      command: python dif_phase2_simulation.py 1000\n      server: local (CPU)\n      data_path: PSN-IRT item_parameters.csv (14042 MMLU items, 4PL→2PL)\n      data_count: 15_conditions_x_1000_reps\n      model_name: N/A (Monte Carlo simulation with real IRT params)\n      seed: 42\n      checkpoint_source: mvp_dif_power_sim\n      eval_data: PSN-IRT MMLU 14042 items real 2PL parameters (a, b)\n    checkpoint_path: artifacts/dif_phase2_results.csv\n    log_path: logs/workers/worker_code_mvp_dif_power_sim_phase2_20260520T185329.log\n    metrics:\n      ets_c_tpr_N80_d14: 0.6823\n      ets_c_tpr_N80_d16: 0.7223\n      ets_c_tpr_N100_d14: 0.7582\n      ets_c_tpr_N100_d16: 0.7966\n      ets_c_fpr_range: 0.036-0.042\n      best_auc_mh: 0.9254\n      best_auc_lr: 0.9405\n      verdict: PASS\n      pass_plus_met: true\n      real_param_a_mean: 1.2\n      real_param_b_mean: -0.84\n    conclusion: success\n    completed_at: '2026-05-20T19:30:16.477Z'\n  plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu:\n    status: DONE\n    retry_count: 0\n    created_at: '2026-05-20T20:54:53.883Z'\n    updated_at: '2026-05-20T21:12:05.153Z'\n    hypothesis: MH-DIF 在 METABENCH 真实 MMLU 数据（5227 模型 × 12508 items）上，用时间 cohort (2023\n      vs 2024) 和能力分位 cohort 分组时，ETS C 标记的 items 在 Li et al. clean items 中的 FPR ≤ 0.05，且\n      ETS C 标记在 contaminated items 中的比例显著高于 clean items。这验证 DIF 在真实数据上不会产生过多假阳性，且能捕捉到与\n      web-overlap 污染信号一致的差异性。\n    parent: mvp_dif_power_sim_phase2\n    spec:\n      command: python plan_001_analysis.py\n      server: local (CPU)\n      data_path: artifacts/response_matrix.npz + model_metadata.csv + item_metadata.csv\n        + mmlu_li2024_proxy_labels.csv\n      data_count: 5227_models_x_12508_items\n      model_name: N/A (MH-DIF statistical analysis)\n      seed: 42\n      checkpoint_source: mvp_dif_power_sim_phase2 (MH-DIF methodology validated)\n      eval_data: METABENCH MMLU 5227 models × 12508 items binary responses + Li et\n        al. 2024 proxy labels (9229 items)\n    metrics:\n      temporal_ets_c_pct: 31.3\n      temporal_fpr_li_clean: 0.318\n      temporal_enrichment: 0.96\n      ability_ets_c_pct: 2.9\n      ability_fpr_li_clean: 0.027\n      ability_enrichment: 1.19\n      within_family_llama2v3_c_pct: 61.3\n      within_family_mistral_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n      domain_spearman_rho: 0.307\n      domain_spearman_p: 0.02\n      sanity_random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n      temporal_ability_jaccard: 0.014\n    checkpoint_path: artifacts/plan_001/\n    log_path: logs/workers/worker_code_plan_001_dif_analysis_20260520T205627.log\n    conclusion: negative\n    notes: 'Temporal cohort DIF (2023 vs 2024): 31.3% ETS C, enrichment=0.96 — DIF\n      detects systematic capability improvement, NOT contamination (clean and contaminated\n      items flagged at equal rates). Ability cohort: 2.9% C, enrichment=1.19 — weak\n      positive signal, FPR=2.7% well controlled. Within-family (Llama-2 vs 3): 61.3%\n      C confirms ability confound dominates. Domain ρ=0.307 (p=0.02) consistent with\n      capability-driven DIF. Sanity check passed (random split 0.18% C). Core finding:\n      naive MH-DIF cannot distinguish contamination from genuine capability improvement\n      without ability matching or IRT equating.'\n    completed_at: '2026-05-20T21:12:05.153Z'\n  plan_001b_matched_ability_dif:\n    status: DONE\n    retry_count: 0\n    created_at: '2026-05-20T21:35:08.552Z'\n    updated_at: '2026-05-20T21:35:51.089Z'\n    hypothesis: 在每个 accuracy quintile 内部做 temporal cohort MH-DIF（控制能力后），enrichment\n      将从 plan_001 的 0.96 提升到 >1.5，证明能力匹配能隔离出污染信号。\n    parent: plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu\n    conclusion: negative\n    notes: 'D005: Matched-ability DIF 失败。所有 quintile enrichment 0.94-1.04。能力匹配未能隔离出污染信号。Reviewer\n      洞察：Li et al. web-overlap 是全局性污染标注（Common Crawl 对所有模型可用），不会产生 group-specific\n      DIF。enrichment≈1.0 可能不是 DIF 方法失败，而是 ground truth 与 DIF 度量的东西根本不同——DIF 检测差异性训练数据包含，Li\n      检测存在性污染。'\n    checkpoint_path: artifacts/plan_001b/\n    log_path: logs/workers/worker_code_plan_001b_matched_ability_dif_20260520T211545.log\n    completed_at: '2026-05-20T21:35:51.089Z'\n  plan_011_semi_synthetic_validation:\n    status: DONE\n    retry_count: 0\n    created_at: '2026-05-20T21:35:55.290Z'\n    updated_at: '2026-05-20T21:54:54.659Z'\n    hypothesis: 在 METABENCH 真实响应矩阵上注入已知差异性污染（focal group 指定 items 的 incorrect→correct\n      翻转）后，MH-DIF 的 ETS C 分类能在 ability-quintile cohort 上达到 TPR>0.5 (p=1.0) 且 FPR<0.05。如果成功，说明\n      plan_001/001b 的 enrichment≈1.0 是 Li et al. ground truth 不匹配（全局性 vs 差异性污染），而非\n      DIF 方法本身失败。\n    parent: plan_001b_matched_ability_dif\n    spec:\n      command: python plan_011_analysis.py\n      server: local (CPU)\n      data_path: artifacts/response_matrix.npz + plan_001 results + Li labels\n      data_count: 500_baseline_items_x_5_p_x_5_seeds_x_2_cohorts_x_3_mh_variants\n      model_name: N/A (semi-synthetic injection + MH-DIF)\n      seed: 1-5 per condition\n      checkpoint_source: plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu\n      eval_data: METABENCH 5227×12508 response matrix with injected differential contamination\n    metrics:\n      temporal_external_tpr_p0: 0.326\n      temporal_external_tpr_p03: 0.548\n      temporal_external_tpr_p05: 0.834\n      temporal_external_tpr_p07: 0.99\n      temporal_external_tpr_p10: 1\n      temporal_external_fpr: 0.314\n      temporal_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.674\n      ability_external_tpr_p0: 0.498\n      ability_external_tpr_p10: 0.8\n      ability_external_fpr: 0.493\n      ability_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.302\n      standard_mh_fpr_inflation: temporal 0.298→0.616 at p=1.0\n      matching_variable_contamination_confirmed: true\n      bug_fix: inf-delta classified as extreme DIF not class A\n    checkpoint_path: artifacts/plan_011/\n    log_path: logs/workers/worker_code_plan_011_semi_synthetic_20260520T213716.log\n    conclusion: success\n    notes: 'MH-DIF successfully detects injected differential contamination. Temporal+external:\n      ΔTPR=+0.674 (0.326→1.000), FPR constant at 0.314. Clear dose-response across\n      p={0.3,0.5,0.7,1.0}. Confirms plan_001/001b enrichment≈1.0 is ground truth mismatch\n      (Li et al. = global contamination, DIF = differential contamination), NOT DIF\n      method failure. Also discovered: (1) matching variable contamination when 20%\n      items injected (standard MH FPR inflates 0.298→0.616, anchor/external variants\n      immune), (2) inf-delta classification bug in plan_001 code fixed. Ability cohort\n      has high baseline FPR (~49%) due to extreme Q1-2 vs Q4-5 ability gap — 5-strata\n      insufficient.'\n    completed_at: '2026-05-20T21:54:54.659Z'\n  plan_012_irt_theta_conditioning:\n    status: DONE\n    retry_count: 0\n    created_at: '2026-05-20T21:58:10.439Z'\n    updated_at: '2026-05-20T22:20:01.371Z'\n    hypothesis: 用 2PL IRT 估计的 θ 值（10-20 等距层）替代粗糙总分作为 MH 分层变量后，semi-synthetic 框架下 baseline\n      FPR 将从 ~31%（temporal）/~49%（ability）降至 <10%，同时保持 TPR>0.70 at p=0.5。θ-conditioning\n      通过更精确的能力匹配消除 impact-vs-DIF 混淆残留。\n    parent: plan_011_semi_synthetic_validation\n    spec:\n      command: python plan_012_irt_theta_analysis.py\n      server: local (CPU)\n      data_path: artifacts/response_matrix.npz + plan_011 framework\n      data_count: 500_baseline_x_5p_x_5seeds_x_2cohorts_x_7variants\n      model_name: N/A (logit θ estimation + MH-DIF)\n      seed: 1-5 per condition\n      checkpoint_source: plan_011_semi_synthetic_validation\n      eval_data: METABENCH 5227×12508 response matrix with θ-conditioned MH stratification\n    metrics:\n      temporal_theta_qt20_fpr: 0.312\n      temporal_theta_qt20_tpr_p05: 0.876\n      temporal_theta_qt20_tpr_p10: 1\n      temporal_external5_fpr: 0.314\n      temporal_external5_tpr_p05: 0.834\n      ability_theta_qt10_fpr: 0.093\n      ability_theta_qt10_tpr_p05: 0.206\n      ability_theta_qt10_tpr_p10: 0.544\n      ability_theta_qt20_fpr: 0.079\n      ability_theta_qt20_tpr_p05: 0.21\n      ability_theta_qt20_tpr_p10: 0.544\n      ability_external5_fpr: 0.493\n      ability_external5_tpr_p05: 0.756\n      theta_total_score_corr: 0.9986\n      enrichment_all_variants: 0.97-1.00\n      success_criterion_met: false\n    conclusion: negative\n    checkpoint_path: artifacts/plan_012/\n    log_path: logs/workers/worker_code_plan_012_irt_theta_20260520T215924.log\n    completed_at: '2026-05-20T22:19:53.152Z'\n    notes: 'θ-conditioning NEGATIVE. Temporal cohort: logit(p) θ corr=0.9986 with\n      total score, all θ variants FPR=31-35% (no improvement over plan_011 external_5\n      FPR=31.4%). TPR well maintained (0.83-0.88 at p=0.5). Ability cohort: quantile\n      θ bins (qt_10/qt_20) reduce FPR from 49% to 8-9%, but TPR collapses from 76%\n      to 21% at p=0.5 — proving plan_011 ability cohort''s high TPR was mainly ability\n      confounding, not genuine DIF detection. Enrichment vs Li et al.: all variants\n      0.97-1.00 (unchanged from plan_001). Key conclusion: temporal cohort 31% baseline\n      FPR is genuine DIF (real item-level differences between 2023 vs 2024 models),\n      not an artifact of imprecise ability matching. Improving θ estimation won''t\n      fix it — need multidimensional or subject-level approaches.'\n  plan_013_q3_local_independence:\n    status: DONE\n    retry_count: 0\n    created_at: '2026-05-20T21:58:11.134Z'\n    updated_at: '2026-05-20T22:36:16.364Z'\n    hypothesis: MMLU 同一 subject 内的 items 存在显著局部依赖性（within-subject Q3 均值 > 0.20，显著高于\n      cross-subject Q3），这违反 2PL IRT 和 MH-DIF 的局部独立性假设，部分解释了 plan_011 中 temporal cohort\n      baseline FPR=31% 的膨胀。如果确认，则动机化后续 bifactor/testlet 模型改进。\n    parent: plan_011_semi_synthetic_validation\n    spec:\n      command: python plan_013_q3_analysis.py\n      server: local (CPU)\n      data_path: artifacts/response_matrix.npz + item_metadata.csv\n      data_count: 12251 items (filtered), 3000+3000 sampled pairs + 57 subjects full\n      model_name: N/A (Q3 residual correlation)\n      seed: N/A\n      checkpoint_source: plan_011_semi_synthetic_validation\n      eval_data: METABENCH 5227×12508 response matrix residual correlations\n    metrics:\n      within_subject_mean_q3: 0.0086\n      cross_subject_mean_q3: 0.0031\n      within_subject_pct_above_020: 11.3\n      cross_subject_pct_above_020: 2.2\n      mann_whitney_p: 2.29e-09\n      worst_subject: moral_scenarios\n      worst_subject_pct_above_020: 34.2\n      n_items_retained: 12251\n      n_items_filtered: 257\n      subject_size_q3_corr: 0.2064\n      subject_size_q3_p: 0.123\n    conclusion: success\n    checkpoint_path: artifacts/plan_013/\n    log_path: logs/workers/worker_code_plan_013_q3_20260520T221944.log\n    notes: 'Q3 诊断完成。Hypothesis 部分验证：within-subject 均值 Q3=0.0086（低于 0.20 阈值），但尾部显著——11.3%\n      within-subject pairs |Q3|>0.20 vs 2.2% cross-subject（5x, Mann-Whitney p=2.3e-9）。局部依赖存在但温和，不太可能单独解释\n      31% FPR。最严重 subjects: moral_scenarios 34.2%, world_religions 18%, marketing\n      17.5%。结论：局部依赖是 FPR 的贡献因素之一，但主要 FPR 来源是 genuine temporal DIF（plan_014 确认 within-subject\n      C%=38%）。'\n    completed_at: '2026-05-20T22:36:16.364Z'\n  plan_014_within_subject_dif:\n    status: DONE\n    retry_count: 0\n    created_at: '2026-05-20T22:23:50.857Z'\n    updated_at: '2026-05-20T22:28:27.350Z'\n    hypothesis: Within-subject temporal DIF（只用该 subject 内 items 和总分）在高 C% subjects\n      上的 C% 将 < 15%，表明 plan_001 的 31% FPR 主要来自 between-subject 能力差异而非 within-subject\n      因素。如果 within-subject C% > 25%，则 bifactor 模型也无法解决 FPR 问题。\n    parent: plan_012_irt_theta_conditioning\n    spec:\n      command: python plan_014_within_subject_dif.py\n      server: local (CPU)\n      data_path: artifacts/response_matrix.npz + item_metadata.csv + model_metadata.csv\n      data_count: 5_subjects_x_2_matching_types\n      model_name: N/A (within-subject MH-DIF)\n      seed: N/A\n      checkpoint_source: plan_012_irt_theta_conditioning\n      eval_data: METABENCH 5 high-C% subjects, within-subject vs cross-subject matching\n    metrics:\n      business_ethics_within_c_pct: 45.2\n      human_aging_within_c_pct: 33\n      formal_logic_within_c_pct: 39.5\n      professional_medicine_within_c_pct: 31.1\n      high_school_statistics_within_c_pct: 42\n      avg_within_subject_c_pct: 38.1\n      avg_cross_subject_c_pct: 40.5\n      avg_delta_within_vs_cross: -2.4\n      sibtest_available: false\n      r_available: false\n      decision_zone: '>25% HIGH'\n    conclusion: negative\n    checkpoint_path: artifacts/plan_014/\n    log_path: logs/workers/worker_code_plan_014_within_subject_dif_20260520T222310.log\n    notes: 'Within-subject temporal DIF 前置检查 NEGATIVE。5 个高 C% subjects 平均 within-subject\n      C%=38.1%（全部 >25%）：business_ethics 45.2%, human_aging 33.0%, formal_logic 39.5%,\n      professional_medicine 31.1%, high_school_statistics 42.0%。Cross-subject matching\n      C% 40.5%（Δ=-2.4pp）。结论：temporal DIF 渗透到每个 subject 内部，不是 between-subject 能力差异的伪影。Bifactor\n      模型大概率无法解决 FPR 问题。SIBTEST: R 不可用，Python 无实现。'\n    completed_at: '2026-05-20T22:28:27.350Z'\n  plan_015_bifactor_irt:\n    status: PREPARING\n    retry_count: 0\n    created_at: '2026-05-20T22:23:51.598Z'\n    updated_at: '2026-05-20T22:30:44.925Z'\n    hypothesis: Bifactor IRT（1 general + 57 subject-specific factors）的 general θ 分层能将\n      temporal cohort baseline FPR 从 31% 降至 <15%，同时在 semi-synthetic 框架下保持 TPR>0.60\n      at p=0.5。Bifactor 通过分离学科特异性能力和通用能力，消除 subject-level 能力差异对 MH-DIF 的混淆。\n    parent: plan_012_irt_theta_conditioning\n    conclusion: killed\n    notes: 'D010: Director 取消。plan_014 前置检查结果 within-subject C%=38.1% (>25%)，证明 temporal\n      DIF 渗透到 subject 内部，bifactor 无法解决。Between-subject variance 反而在压低 overall C%。'\n  plan_016_within_subject_semi_synthetic:\n    status: DONE\n    retry_count: 0\n    created_at: '2026-05-20T22:30:50.476Z'\n    updated_at: '2026-05-20T22:49:02.342Z'\n    hypothesis: 在 subject 内部使用 within-subject total score 做 MH 分层的 semi-synthetic\n      injection 中，DIF 仍能检测差异性污染（ΔTPR > 0.3 at p=0.5）。这证明 DIF 方法在 subject 级别也有效，plan_014\n      的 38% within-subject C% 反映的是真实代际能力差异而非方法失败。\n    parent: plan_014_within_subject_dif\n    spec:\n      command: python plan_016_within_subject_injection.py\n      server: local (CPU)\n      data_path: artifacts/response_matrix.npz + item_metadata.csv + model_metadata.csv\n      data_count: 3_subjects_x_3p_x_5seeds\n      model_name: N/A (within-subject semi-synthetic MH-DIF)\n      seed: 1-5 per condition\n      checkpoint_source: plan_014_within_subject_dif\n      eval_data: METABENCH within-subject injection on business_ethics/human_aging/professional_medicine\n    metrics:\n      within_matching:\n        subjects_passing_p05: 3/5 (human_aging, professional_medicine, formal_logic)\n        business_ethics_baseline_fpr: 0.563\n        business_ethics_delta_tpr_p05: -0.078\n        human_aging_baseline_fpr: 0.334\n        human_aging_delta_tpr_p05: 0.385\n        professional_medicine_baseline_fpr: 0.312\n        professional_medicine_delta_tpr_p05: 0.327\n        formal_logic_baseline_fpr: 0.409\n        formal_logic_delta_tpr_p05: 0.457\n        high_school_statistics_baseline_fpr: 0.407\n        high_school_statistics_delta_tpr_p05: 0.194\n        fpr_inflates_with_injection: true\n        avg_fpr_inflation_p10: 0.186\n      cross_matching:\n        subjects_passing_p05: 4/5 (human_aging, professional_medicine, formal_logic,\n          high_school_statistics)\n        business_ethics_baseline_fpr: 0.533\n        business_ethics_delta_tpr_p05: 0.056\n        human_aging_baseline_fpr: 0.431\n        human_aging_delta_tpr_p05: 0.375\n        professional_medicine_baseline_fpr: 0.38\n        professional_medicine_delta_tpr_p05: 0.38\n        formal_logic_baseline_fpr: 0.402\n        formal_logic_delta_tpr_p05: 0.543\n        high_school_statistics_baseline_fpr: 0.335\n        high_school_statistics_delta_tpr_p05: 0.433\n        fpr_stable_across_injection: true\n        delta_fpr_all_subjects: 0\n      success_criterion_met: true\n    conclusion: success\n    checkpoint_path: artifacts/plan_016/\n    log_path: logs/workers/worker_code_plan_016_within_subject_injection_20260520T223139.log\n    notes: 'Revised per Director review. (1) Fixed comparison table FPR (0.048→0.314).\n      (2) Added cross-subject matching: FPR completely stable (ΔFPR=0.000 all 5 subjects),\n      better detection (4/5 ΔTPR>0.3 vs within 3/5). Within-subject FPR inflates +0.067\n      to +0.281 at p=1.0 due to matching variable contamination. (3) Added formal_logic\n      (109 items, ΔTPR=+0.543 cross) and high_school_statistics (181 items, ΔTPR=+0.433\n      cross). Both 5 strata, clean detection. Cross-subject matching confirms plan_011''s\n      external MH finding at subject level.'\n    completed_at: '2026-05-20T22:37:39.346Z'\n  plan_017_downstream_impact:\n    status: DONE\n    retry_count: 0\n    created_at: '2026-05-20T23:44:12.194Z'\n    updated_at: '2026-05-21T00:05:41.991Z'\n    hypothesis: 移除 temporal DIF-flagged items (ETS C, ~31% of MMLU items) 后，模型跨代排名更稳定（Spearman\n      ρ 提升），且稳定性提升显著优于随机移除相同数量 items 的 baseline。这证明 DIF 不只标记 noise，而是精确识别了 problematic\n      items，为 DIF 作为 benchmark quality tool 提供 downstream evidence。\n    parent: plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu\n    spec:\n      command: python plan_017_downstream_impact.py\n      server: local (CPU)\n      data_path: artifacts/response_matrix.npz + item_metadata.csv + model_metadata.csv\n        + plan_001 DIF results\n      data_count: 5227 models × 12508 items\n      model_name: N/A (downstream impact analysis)\n      seed: 42 + 20 random baselines\n      checkpoint_source: plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu\n      eval_data: METABENCH temporal DIF ETS classification\n    metrics:\n      n_dif_items: 3918\n      n_stable_items: 8590\n      dif_pct: 31.3\n      rho_full_vs_stable_2023: 0.998851\n      rho_full_vs_stable_2024: 0.997014\n      rho_full_vs_stable_all: 0.996451\n      shr_full: 0.9934\n      shr_stable: 0.9919\n      dif_vs_random_z_mean: -14.91\n      dif_vs_random_all_21_conditions_significant: true\n      dif_removal_MORE_disruptive_than_random: true\n      cross_cohort_ratio_dif_vs_full: 1.0919\n      cross_cohort_ratio_stable_vs_full: 0.9581\n      top_beneficiaries: phi-3, llama-3 derivatives\n      top_hurt: mistral merges, slerp models\n      max_rank_change: 851\n    conclusion: negative\n    notes: 'Hypothesis REJECTED but finding is richer. DIF removal causes MORE ranking\n      disruption than random (z=-8 to -49σ, 21/21 conditions). DIF items are NOT noise\n      — they carry concentrated differential information that systematically discriminates\n      models. Key insight: DIF items capture temporal instability (1.09× cross-cohort\n      accuracy swing vs 0.96× stable items). Rankings are very robust (ρ>0.996 even\n      at 38% removal). Top beneficiaries of DIF items: phi-3 and llama-3 derivatives\n      (+700-850 ranks). Top hurt: mistral merges/slerp models (-400 to -587 ranks).\n      Paper narrative shift: DIF items are not \"bad items to remove\" but \"items that\n      reveal differential model capabilities across generations\" — supports characterization\n      narrative over cleaning narrative.'\n    checkpoint_path: artifacts/plan_017/\n    log_path: logs/workers/worker_code_plan_017_downstream_impact_20260520T234507.log\n    completed_at: '2026-05-21T00:05:41.991Z'\n  plan_004_gsm8k_cross_benchmark:\n    status: DONE\n    retry_count: 0\n    created_at: '2026-05-21T00:30:09.372Z'\n    updated_at: '2026-05-21T01:22:16.029Z'\n    hypothesis: GSM8K 的 temporal DIF (2023 vs 2024) 将展示与 MMLU 类似的 30-40% ETS C%，证明\n      temporal DIF 现象跨 benchmark 泛化。使用 METABENCH 其他 benchmarks 总分做 external matching（GSM8K\n      无 subject 分层），预期 baseline FPR 更可控。如果 C% 在同一量级 → DIF 作为 benchmark health diagnostic\n      的泛化性得到验证。\n    parent: plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu\n    metrics:\n      step1_gsm8k_temporal_dif:\n        n_items: 1319\n        n_ref: 1017\n        n_foc: 804\n        standard_c_pct: 18.9\n        external_c_pct: 47.4\n        sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n        standard_external_spearman: 0.926\n      step2_semi_synthetic:\n        standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n        external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.517\n      step3_gsm1k_correlation:\n        n_models: 33\n        n_dif_c_items: 249\n        pearson_r: -0.478\n        pearson_p: 0.005\n        spearman_rho: -0.403\n        spearman_p: 0.02\n        partial_r_controlling_accuracy: -0.385\n        partial_p: 0.027\n        permutation_p: 0.014\n        dif_c_favor_2024: 78\n        dif_c_favor_2023: 171\n        direction: NEGATIVE (opposite to contamination hypothesis)\n        cook_d_max_model: Deepseek-math-7b-rl\n        leave_one_out_r_range: -0.537 to -0.374\n        robust: true\n    notes: 'Step 3 GSM1K correlation: r=-0.478 (p=0.005). |r|>0.3 threshold met but\n      direction NEGATIVE — opposite to contamination hypothesis. DIF-C items disadvantage\n      contaminated models, not advantage them. 171/249 DIF-C items favor older models.\n      Partial r=-0.385 (p=0.027) controlling for overall accuracy. Permutation p=0.014.\n      Robust to leave-one-out. Interpretation: DIF captures genuine measurement anomalies\n      orthogonal to contamination. Contamination produces narrow boost on typical\n      items, fails on atypical-difficulty items (DIF-C). Supports characterization\n      narrative: DIF as benchmark health diagnostic, not contamination detector.'\n    spec:\n      command: python plan_004_step1/2/3 scripts\n      server: local (CPU)\n      data_path: artifacts/metabench_data/benchmark-data/gsm8k.csv + gsm1k_model_accuracy.csv\n      data_count: 1319 items × 6702 models (GSM8K) + 33 models (GSM1K)\n      model_name: N/A (cross-benchmark DIF analysis)\n      seed: 42 + 5 seeds per condition + 1000 permutations\n      checkpoint_source: plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu\n      eval_data: METABENCH GSM8K + GSM1K paper accuracy data\n    checkpoint_path: artifacts/plan_004/\n    log_path: logs/workers/worker_code_plan_004_step3_gsm1k_correlation_20260521T011144.log\n    conclusion: negative\n    completed_at: '2026-05-21T01:22:16.029Z'\n","numLines":488,"startLine":1,"totalLines":488}}}
